Writer: keep supported legacy EQ formulas as editable EQ fields

Rebuild supported fields from the current formula tree, not saved source XML.
OMML inline fractions use different sizing than Word's legacy EQ fields.
The source-kind marker survives MathML roundtrips; unsupported model nodes
continue through the existing OMML exporter. The safe set is ASCII literal
text, one-line expressions, uniform-size wrappers and nested fractions with
one current font, size and posture. Other equations are unchanged.

